# Chips while available, without the mission: a fresh char (CoP not on One to be Feared, nor past it) is not offered 169
# at Ghebi Damomohe (his own script answers); the three chips at Cid while available (no trade handler in the available
# section: nothing, the chips kept).
lists LowerJeuno/Ghebi_Damomohe/onTrigger Metalworks/Cid/onTrade
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=15.5,-0.1,-6.1
item CarmineChip
item CyanChip
item GrayChip
login
trigger Ghebi_Damomohe               # no CoP 6-4: nil, his script
finish-if-event
warp -12.6,-11,4 Metalworks
trade Cid CarmineChip x1 CyanChip x1 GrayChip x1  # available: no trade handler, nothing
